        OO -->|Dismiss| RR[📱 Continue Activity]
        
        PP --> SS[🧭 Qibla Compass Display]
        SS --> TT[🤲 Prayer Complete]
        QQ --> UU[🔔 Prayer Reminder Again]
        UU --> OO
        
        VV[💎 Dhikr Time Triggered] --> WW[✨ Show Dhikr Overlay]
        WW --> XX{Display Method}
        XX -->|Overlay| YY[📱 Screen Overlay Display]
        XX -->|Notification| ZZ[🔔 Push Notification]
        
        YY --> AAA[👁️ User Views Dhikr]
        ZZ --> AAA
        AAA --> BBB[🕐 Auto-Dismiss After Duration]
        BBB --> CCC[📈 Track Dhikr Interaction]
    end

    subgraph "⚙️ Customization Journey"
        DDD[👤 User Opens Settings] --> EEE{What to Configure?}
        EEE -->|Detection| FFF[🎯 Adjust Sensitivity]
        EEE -->|Performance| GGG[⚡ Change Performance Mode]
        EEE -->|Islamic| HHH[🕌 Configure Islamic Features]
        EEE -->|Apps| III[📱 Manage App Whitelist]
        EEE -->|Visual| JJJ[🎨 Customize Blur Style]
        
        FFF --> KKK[🔧 Test New Settings]
        GGG --> KKK
        HHH --> LLL[🕌 Preview Islamic Content]
        III --> MMM[📱 Select/Deselect Apps]
        JJJ --> NNN[🎨 Preview Blur Effects]
        
        KKK --> OOO[✅ Save Settings]
        LLL --> OOO
        MMM --> OOO
        NNN --> OOO
        
        OOO --> PPP[🔄 Apply Changes]
        PPP --> QQQ[📊 Monitor Performance]
    end

    subgraph "🚨 Emergency & Troubleshooting"
        RRR[⚠️ User Needs Emergency Stop] --> SSS[🔴 Emergency Button]
        SSS --> TTT[⏸️ Temporary Disable]
        TTT --> UUU[⏰ Auto Re-enable Timer]
        UUU --> VVV[✅ Service Restored]
        
        WWW[🐛 Performance Issues] --> XXX{Issue Type}
        XXX -->|Battery Drain| YYY[🔋 Switch to Ultra-Fast Mode]
        XXX -->|App Crashes| ZZZ[📱 Restart Service]
        XXX -->|False Positives| AAAA[🎯 Adjust Sensitivity]
        XXX -->|Slow Performance| BBBB[⚡ Lower Detection Quality]
        
        YYY --> CCCC[📊 Monitor Improvement]
        ZZZ --> CCCC
        AAAA --> CCCC
        BBBB --> CCCC
    end

